  "question": {
    "text": "The magnetic field at the centre of a current-carrying loop of radius 0.1 m is <math><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math> times that at a point along its axis. What is the distance (in <math><mtext>m</mtext></math>) of this point from the centre of the loop?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that,<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Given that, <math><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />On squaring both sides, we get<br /><br /><math><mn>25</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mroot><mrow><mn>125</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mroot><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>0.01</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.01</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.04</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mn>&nbsp;m</mn></math>",
